<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠγος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρυγξ</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pickaxe</i> or
				<i>any sharp iron tool for digging,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.297
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phan.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>gazelle</i> or <i>antelope,</i> in Egypt and Libya, so
			called from its <i>pointed horns, beisa, Oryx leucoryx,</i>
			described as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονόκερως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				499b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				663a23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				14.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.353
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.974f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.446
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄ. τετράκερως</span> Indian four-horned
				<i>antelope, Tetraceros quadricornis,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				15.14
			</span></i> ; also an Indian <i>gazelle,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				13.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a great
			fish, perh. <i>narwhal, Monodon monoceros,</i> or a kind of whale,
				<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.2.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
